abstract: >-
  Mathematical-structural research portfolio investigating Antikythera-style
  bronze mechanisms, ephemeris computation, chess piece-graph spectra, and
  related spectral systems through cyclic-group algebra, graph-Laplacian
  eigenbasis, and hyperdimensional computing primitives. Includes the
  Stored-Relationship Mechanism (srmech) Python package implementing a
  14-class primitive vocabulary (Spike #24 enumeration) with native C
  parity surface, the Attested Multi-Source Collector framework with
  Mathematical Provenance Record (MPR) v1 on-disk format, and a family
  of spectral-research notebooks framed under the Metric Field Ontology
  (MFO) candidate methodological lens. Co-developed with large-language-
  model agents (Claude Opus 4.7, Anthropic, 1M-context configuration)
  per the project's mellifluous-orchestra collaboration discipline.
